/ Ventilation du montant EXIGIBLE + bouton « Payer le solde » (epic #55, Phase 3).
/ « Exigible » = hébergement/espaces + activités VALIDÉES − encaissé. Les activités
/ EN ATTENTE de validation sont affichées mais NON facturées (non exigibles).
- if @stay.show_balance_section?
  div(data-stay-balance="true")
    dl.space-y-2.text-sm
      .flex.items-center.justify-between
        dt(class="text-moss") = t("public.stays.balance.lodging_and_spaces")
        dd.text-ink.whitespace-nowrap = @stay.formatted_lodging_and_spaces

      - if @stay.has_confirmed_experiences?
        .flex.items-center.justify-between
          dt(class="text-moss") = t("public.stays.balance.experiences_confirmed")
          dd.text-ink.whitespace-nowrap = @stay.formatted_experiences_confirmed

      - if @stay.has_pending_experiences?
        .flex.items-center.justify-between(class="text-moss/70" data-balance-pending="true")
          dt
            = t("public.stays.balance.experiences_pending")
            span.ml-1.text-xs.italic = t("public.stays.balance.experiences_pending_note")
          dd.whitespace-nowrap = @stay.formatted_experiences_pending

      - if @stay.amount_paid_cents.positive?
        .flex.items-center.justify-between.text-green-700
          dt = t("public.stays.balance.amount_paid")
          dd.whitespace-nowrap = "− #{@stay.formatted_amount_paid}"

      /  Séjour annulé : le « reste dû » n'a plus d'objet — seul l'encaissé compte.
      - unless @stay.canceled?
        .flex.items-center.justify-between.border-t.pt-3.mt-3(class="border-bark")
          dt.text-base.font-semibold.text-ink = t("public.stays.balance.balance_due")
          dd.text-xl.font-bold.text-forest.whitespace-nowrap(data-balance-due="true") = @stay.formatted_balance_due

    - if @stay.show_balance_cta?
      .mt-5(data-stay-balance-cta="true")
        = button_to t("public.stays.balance.pay_balance_cta", amount: @stay.formatted_balance_due),
                    public_stay_balance_payment_path(@stay.token),
                    method: :post,
                    data: { turbo: false },
                    class: "inline-flex items-center rounded-xl bg-forest px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-sand shadow-sm hover:bg-forest-soft"
